  "notes": [
    "Do not scale the drawing; follow written dimensions. Room sizes are clear inside sizes (wall face to wall face).",
    "Structure: load-bearing masonry. All external and internal walls 9\" (230 mm) brick in cement mortar 1:6.",
    "Padavi is open (no walls). Its RCC slab is carried by 6 RCC pillars 9\" x 9\": 4 along the front (6'-10\" clear bays) and 2 at the back corners against the house front wall, with RCC beams along the front and both sides. Pillar, beam and footing sizes to be confirmed by the structural engineer.",
    "Provide RCC plinth band and RCC lintel band (6\" deep) over all walls; door/window tops at lintel level 7'-0\".",
    "Assumed levels, confirm with engineer: plinth +1'-6\" above road, floor-to-floor 10'-0\", lintel +7'-0\" above floor.",
    "Bathroom and toilet: sunken slab 1'-0\", waterproofing 1'-0\" up the walls (3'-0\" in shower), floor 1/2\" below kitchen, sloped to FT.",
    "Staircase to the first floor is not shown; its position will be fixed with the first-floor plan.",
    "Kitchen: L-shaped platform 2'-0\" deep at 2'-8\" height, along the hall-side wall from O2 and up the left wall past W2, sink under W2; provide chimney/exhaust opening on the left wall.",
    "Toilet has two WCs: Indian pan (IWC) on the rear wall and wall-hung western WC (EWC) with concealed cistern on the right wall, giving 1'-10\" clear in front. Provide health faucets for both.",
    "Passage in front of bathroom/toilet is 2'-3\" clear. Electrical, plumbing and structural drawings to be issued separately.",
    "Windows W1/W2 face 1'-0\" to 1'-6\" side gaps; confirm neighbour clearance before fixing."
  ]
